# Upload only the two python files and the dockerfile. Without this the
# context is the whole repo and Library/ alone is 5 GB.
#
# ⚠ The negations must re-open each PARENT directory before its children.
# gitignore semantics say a file cannot be re-included if a parent directory
# is excluded, so a bare `*` + `!website/tools/**` uploads NOTHING — see the
# 54-byte context measured in .gcloudignore.worker.
/*
!/website
/website/*
!/website/tools
/website/tools/*
!/website/tools/bake_showcase.py
!/website/tools/refresh_showcase_cloud.py
!/website/tools/Dockerfile.showcase
